1
00:00:43,214 --> 00:00:46,555
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,555 --> 00:00:49,547
=Episode 20=

3
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:52,000
- Full house.
- Playing?

4
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,207
Pass.

5
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:55,938
You go first?

6
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:57,552
Three of a kind plus one.

7
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,705
- Your turn.
- Pass.

8
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:03,014
Only two cards left.

9
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,240
Nice!

10
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:06,680
You're on fire today,

11
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:07,716
Ms. Lei.

12
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,720
Su Dawei,

13
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:13,040
if your daughter hadn't paid off

14
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,680
the debt you owed us,

15
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,320
you'd be dead already.

16
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:18,560
What now? Can't hold it back

17
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:20,060
and here to give us money?

18
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:22,000
Come on.

19
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,720
Last time was just an accident.

20
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:26,840
My wife and that girl
hid the money from me.

21
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:29,828
Otherwise, why would I trouble you?

22
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:31,920
But this time is different.

23
00:01:32,440 --> 00:01:33,520
I can feel

24
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:34,680
my luck has changed.

25
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:35,880
I'll definitely win.

26
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:37,363
Win?

27
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,560
You?

28
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:40,800
A loser who never wins?

29
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,080
Fine.

30
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:44,200
You can play.

31
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,120
Where's the cash?

32
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:47,174
Show it to me.

33
00:01:47,174 --> 00:01:48,211
Well...

34
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:49,974
Ms. Lei.

35
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:52,160
Well... Lend me some.

36
00:01:52,440 --> 00:01:54,923
Once I win,
I'll pay you back with interest.

37
00:01:54,923 --> 00:01:57,520
Shut it! I never do credit here.

38
00:01:58,640 --> 00:01:59,800
No cash? Then get lost!

39
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,196
Get out of my sight.

40
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,436
Ms. Lei,

41
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,719
calm down.

42
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,600
But still,

43
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:08,120
that debt Dawei owed last time

44
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:09,840
wasn't a small amount.

45
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:12,440
His wife is an ordinary worker.

46
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,760
Where did she get all that money?

47
00:02:14,880 --> 00:02:15,960
I bet

48
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,240
that money wasn't clean.

49
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,765
Makes sense.

50
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,480
Tell me,

51
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:25,200
could your wife be doing something shady

52
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:26,640
behind your back?

53
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,520
Impossible!

54
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,880
She doesn't have the guts.

55
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:32,500
By the way, Ms. Lei,

56
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:34,040
a couple of nights ago,

57
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,920
outside the abandoned plant
in West District,

58
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:37,960
I ran into Dawei's daughter.

59
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:38,977
What's her name?

60
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,270
Gu Xiaotang, right?

61
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,080
She sneaked in

62
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:43,160
and stayed for a long time.

63
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:44,880
What would a young girl like her

64
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:46,600
be doing in a place like that so late?

65
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:51,320
Right! I remember now, Ms. Lei.

66
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,920
My girl must have a trick up her sleeve.

67
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,320
She must've hidden the money there.

68
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:57,000
I'll go catch her now

69
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,240
and bring the money to you.

70
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,341
Fine.

71
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:01,720
If you have money,

72
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,080
you're welcome here.

73
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:04,595
If not,

74
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,995
don't ever come again.

75
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,415
Let's keep playing.

76
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,880
Gu Xiaotang.

77
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:20,914
Gu Xiaotang!

78
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:24,560
Are you deaf, brat?

79
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,316
What...

80
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:28,760
What are you doing here?

81
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,760
Why are you coming here?

82
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:35,640
Did you hide the money here?

83
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:37,160
- Give me the money.
- No.

84
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:40,000
- I'm just passing by.
- Passing by?

85
00:03:40,440 --> 00:03:41,509
Don't try to fool me.

86
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:43,360
You're passing by wearing headphones

87
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,520
in the late night?

88
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,680
What's in that bag?

89
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,761
Is it money?

90
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:48,960
No, it's...

91
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,080
Dad, no!

92
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:52,440
- I... No.
- Is it money? Let me check!

93
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:53,575
It's not money!

94
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:54,720
- Let me check!
- No!

95
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:55,830
Let go!

96
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,600
Where did you hide the money?

97
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:04,640
Money...

98
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:09,286
Spill it.

99
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:12,760
You really hid it inside?

100
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:15,680
Dad, no!

101
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:17,200
It's dangerous over there. Don't go.

102
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:19,360
You called me Dad?

103
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,920
You've never called me Dad before.

104
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,800
There must be something fishy.

105
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,240
Dad!

106
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:26,320
It's dangerous in there.

107
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:28,360
There are dogs, and they'll bite!

108
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:30,200
- Don't go!
- Dangerous?

109
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,520
- Who are you kidding? Move!
- Dad!

110
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:35,120
Dad!

111
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:57,040
Xiaotang!

112
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,074
Open the door!

113
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,640
He has multiple lacerations,

114
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:36,640
and severe blood loss.

115
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:37,920
He needs surgery immediately,

116
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,240
or his life will be in danger.

117
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:41,560
Go pay the fees,
so we can do the surgery.

118
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,330
Doctor,

119
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,400
we don't have any money left.

120
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:50,200
To pay off my dad's debt,

121
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:51,680
I've already used up every penny.

122
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:53,440
My mom is still in the hospital.

123
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,760
We really can't afford this.

124
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,604
Please,

125
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:59,840
can you help us?

126
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,840
Sorry, we can't.

127
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:07,280
Gu Xiaotang.

128
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:11,120
- Dad.
- You set me up.

129
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:13,080
Dad,

130
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:14,560
why would you think that?

131
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:17,080
I tried to stop you from going in,

132
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,240
but you insisted on going anyway.

133
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:21,520
I won't let you off.

134
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,275
Dad,

135
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:24,560
I'm your daughter.

136
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,214
Even if we're not blood-related,

137
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:28,640
I've always treated you
like my own father.

138
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,718
Dad,

139
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:33,332
I told you before,

140
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,440
you chose

141
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:37,000
this path yourself.

142
00:06:40,268 --> 00:06:42,192
You chose this path yourself.

143
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:44,440
So what if I chose it?

144
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:47,322
You!

145
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:52,120
Dad, I've thought of a way.

146
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,520
The police will be here soon.

147
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:55,680
Once they look into
what you did to my mom,

148
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:57,680
they'll put you in jail.

149
00:06:58,280 --> 00:06:59,360
They'll

150
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,920
take good care of you there.

151
00:07:17,439 --> 00:07:19,502
Don't worry,
your mom has been stabilized.

152
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,365
Thank you.

153
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,640
Let her get some rest.

154
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:35,469
Xiaotang,

155
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:37,680
about the loop you mentioned,

156
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,880
how does it get triggered?

157
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,800
If I die,

158
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,640
the loop resets.

159
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:45,520
But I noticed that if you die before me,

160
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:48,380
the starting point of the loop
would move further back in time.

161
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,160
Would I die too?

162
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:53,840
I almost succeeded last time.

163
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,166
But to protect me,

164
00:07:55,166 --> 00:07:56,182
you were stabbed.

165
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:58,040
To bring you back to life,

166
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,350
I had to kill myself.

167
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,960
You must protect yourself.

168
00:08:03,225 --> 00:08:04,272
Otherwise, if you die,

169
00:08:04,272 --> 00:08:05,560
all our efforts and bond

170
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,570
will go to waste.

171
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,507
Xiaotang.

172
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:14,480
How's

173
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:15,537
your mom?

174
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:18,200
Don't worry, I got you the best doctor.

175
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,120
And I've arranged
all the follow-up checkups.

176
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,751
Ms. Lei,

177
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:23,937
thank you.

178
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,760
Don't mention it.

179
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,840
Without you,

180
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:28,080
I'd still be fighting

181
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:29,879
over pocket change in the pool hall.

182
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,120
By the way, what do you want

183
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,120
to do with that scumbag?

184
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,202
Just say the word,

185
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:37,600
and I'll make him disappear tonight.

186
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:39,160
No need. I've handled him.

187
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:41,680
Ms. Lei,

188
00:08:41,680 --> 00:08:43,720
thank you for your men tonight.

189
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:45,040
Especially

190
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:49,920
Lu Qingyuan.

191
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,109
Qingyuan?

192
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:54,503
Qingyuan.

193
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:55,967
Qingyuan.

194
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,357
Come over here.

195
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,215
Hurry.

196
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,800
Xiaotang is praising you.

197
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:07,080
Back at the pool hall,

198
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:09,360
you wanted to chop off
my finger for the debt.

199
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:11,680
Being so bloodthirsty
at such a young age

200
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:13,000
isn't good.

201
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:17,040
Ms. Lei, you'd better
teach this guy a lesson.

202
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:21,575
Lu Qingyuan,

203
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:22,880
are you deaf?

204
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:25,480
Kneel down
and apologize for what you did.

205
00:09:33,040 --> 00:09:34,058
Enough.

206
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,440
Just learn your lesson.

207
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:39,840
Don't use Ms. Lei's power
to bully anyone again.

208
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:41,680
You're really gracious.

209
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,115
Get lost.

210
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,005
Xiaotang,

211
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,440
I found a job for your mom.

212
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,760
With the money you helped me make,

213
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,160
I leased a few warehouses.

214
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:54,680
And I need a warehouse keeper.

215
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:56,680
She can work indoor and keep track

216
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:57,688
of inventory.

217
00:09:57,688 --> 00:09:58,720
It's an easy job,

218
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,720
with great pay.

219
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,364
You two can live in peace.

220
00:10:01,364 --> 00:10:02,480
Ms. Lei,

221
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,560
I'm truly grateful

222
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:05,297
for this favor.

223
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,441
Don't mention it.

224
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,907
Anyway, it's getting late.

225
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:22,240
I won't bother you and your boyfriend.

226
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:23,690
I'm leaving.

227
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,320
W-What did she just say?

228
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,265
You're my boyfriend?

229
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:38,343
Really?

230
00:10:38,800 --> 00:10:39,800
I didn't catch that.

231
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,440
Did I mishear?

232
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,480
How did I never notice before

233
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:53,960
that our school is this beautiful?

234
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:57,000
The air feels so fresh.

235
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:07,640
Let me introduce myself.

236
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:09,486
I'm the director
of Xingyao Model Agency.

237
00:11:09,486 --> 00:11:10,491
My surname is Li.

238
00:11:10,491 --> 00:11:12,832
You caught my eye
at the school gate just now.

239
00:11:17,520 --> 00:11:19,040
(Director Li.)

240
00:11:55,485 --> 00:11:58,841
♪The face deep in the heart♪

241
00:11:59,033 --> 00:12:01,495
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

242
00:12:02,870 --> 00:12:06,570
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

243
00:12:06,781 --> 00:12:09,221
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

244
00:12:09,368 --> 00:12:11,740
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

245
00:12:11,890 --> 00:12:14,647
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

246
00:12:14,647 --> 00:12:16,968
♪Even for just a second♪

247
00:12:18,313 --> 00:12:21,776
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

248
00:12:21,904 --> 00:12:23,753
♪And sunlight reverses♪

249
00:12:23,753 --> 00:12:27,223
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

250
00:12:27,579 --> 00:12:29,653
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

251
00:12:30,155 --> 00:12:33,564
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

252
00:12:33,821 --> 00:12:39,033
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

253
00:12:40,287 --> 00:12:42,852
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

254
00:12:42,894 --> 00:12:46,347
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

255
00:12:46,924 --> 00:12:49,887
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

256
00:12:50,632 --> 00:12:53,240
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

257
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:56,863
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

258
00:12:57,333 --> 00:13:01,389
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
